packages/server/src/import/world/fixtures/

# Claude Code's local state — and its scratch worktrees, which are whole second
# checkouts of this repository. Every entry above is anchored to the root, so
# none of them reach inside one, and a machine that has ever made a worktree
# fails the gate over a copy of files already ignored here.
#
# `launch.json` is the one file under `.claude/` that git tracks, and it is
# tempting to exempt it with a `!` line so it stays formatted. It cannot be: the
# tool rewrites it into every worktree it creates, and on Windows it writes CRLF,
# so `--check` fails on a file whose committed blob is — and always was — LF.
# `.gitattributes` does not reach it either; those bytes arrive after checkout,
# from a writer this repository does not own.
.claude/*
